    "https://www.csu.edu.au/jobs/": {
      "title": "Jobs @ Charles Sturt",
      "description": "Jobs @ Charles Sturt - Jobs @ Charles Sturt Skip to main content Future Students Staff Alumni Library Faculties & Schools Jobs News About Contacts Student Portal Jobs @ Charles Sturt search search Home Vacancies Who we are Benefits Applying International applicants Contact us Jobs @ Charles Sturt Welcome Vacancies redirect Who we are Benefits Applying International applicants Contact us Future Students Staff Alumni Library Faculties & Schools Jobs News About Contacts Student Portal Jobs @ Charles Sturt Home Careers at Charles Sturt Connecting passion with opportunity Our vacancies Charles Sturt research narrative Providing meaningful outcomes for industry, government, business, and communities through three interdisciplinary research spheres. Find out more Careers at Charles Sturt Connecting passion with opportunity Our Vacancies Careers at Charles Sturt Connecting passion with opportunity Our vacancies Next Prev 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 Jobs @ Charles Sturt Charles Sturt University is a young and growing university committed to developing visionary people who help their communities grow and flourish. We make a significant contribution to the prosperity and vibrancy of our rural and regional communities, with a reach and impact across Australia and internationally. We work together with industry, communities and students to create new thinking, inspire each other and make a positive and progressive contribution to the world. Our vacancies View all vacancies Our registers Register your interest at working at Charles Sturt Casual Academic Staff Casual Professional/General Staff Benefits As part of working with us, you will enjoy a number of benefits including a great work-life balance, professional development opportunities and generous financial rewards. Find out more chevron_right Who we are We’re a regional university, and proud of it. We have strong connections to industry and our rural and regional communities and high graduate employment. We’re a young and growing university. Our success is driven by the enthusiasm and dedication of our staff in shaping the future and realising the full potential of our students. Find out more chevron_right Join our mailing list Make keeping up-to-date with our vacancies easy. Subscribe to our mailing service to regularly receive vacancy updates. Subscribe chevron_right International applicants We understand relocating to Australia to take up a position with us is a significant decision, affecting both you and your family; so getting it right is important. The information provided in the link below will assist you in understanding some important aspects of relocating and living in Australia. More information chevron_right Designs Folder expand_more Home Vacancies Who we are Benefits Applying International applicants Contact us Enquiries expand_more Phone: 1800 275 278 International: +61 1800 275 278 Enquire Here 'Yindyamarra Winhanganha' - The wisdom of respectfully knowing how to live well in a world worth living in We pay our respect to all First Nations elders both past and\n            present from the lands where Charles Sturt University students reside. In particular, we acknowledge the Wiradjuri,\n            Ngunawal, Gundungurra, and Birpai peoples of Australia, who are the traditional custodians of the land\n            where Charles Sturt University campuses are located. Jobs @ Charles Sturt Home Vacancies Who we are Benefits Applying International applicants Contact us Enquiries Contact us Stay Connected Facebook Twitter Instagram Youtube LinkedIn © 2026 Charles Sturt University - TEQSA Provider Identification: PRV12018 (Australian University). CRICOS Provider: 00005F. Registration and Regulatory Status | Disclaimer & Copyright | Accessibility | Privacy"
